# Used automatically by `npm run build:native` (vite build --mode staging),
# not by plain `npm run build`/`npm run dev` - those still default to .env's
# localhost:3000 for local full-stack dev, unchanged. Native builds need a
# real, reachable api/ instance instead: a local build has no dev server
# alongside it the way a browser tab does, so localhost silently fails
# there with no visible cause (confirmed on a real iOS Simulator run).
# Committed, not a secret - this is the same public staging URL CI already
# hardcodes in .github/workflows/ci.yml's deploy-web-staging job.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://goodgorithm-api-staging.up.railway.app
